  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 701.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 701.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to establish the criteria and methods to be used to designate, map, and document prime wetlands, and to amend filed maps and designations of prime wetlands per RSA 482-A.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 700) #12807, eff 12-15-19; ss by #13946, eff 4-27-24",
